<title>AUSTRIA: Lenzing sells fibre stake to Hoechst.</title>
<headline>Lenzing sells fibre stake to Hoechst.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian fibre maker Lenzing AG has agreed to sell its 49 percent stake in Austria Faserwerke to Hoechst Trevira AG, a unit of Germany's Hoechst AG, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining 51 percent is already owned by Hoechst's Austrian unit, Hoechst Austria AG. Financial details of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
